  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Description: \nToggling the Lock of the 2.0 menu prevent the player from interacting with the menu when using Vive Wands. The lock cannot be toggled on again and nothing in the menu can be selected. \nSteps to repro: \n1. Using Vive Wand Controllers, log into Vrchat.\n2. Open the Quick Menu. \n3. Select a Tab (ex : world)\n4. Press the Lock in the bottom right.\n5. Attempt to select anything else.\n6. Attempt to close the Lock again.\nNotes:\n• Closing the game and rebooting doesn't fix the issue either.\n• Uninstalling the beta , launching Live and redownloading the Beta didn't fix it.\n• The only thing that works in the menu after the issue",
